 on entertainment-related products and services.</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </span></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">In January 2024, the AutoSense Divestiture was completed for total consideration of $</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_f8d954f6-ae9c-429d-bd55-dd9c6e917798" contextRef="C_bdc7bba5-f4ac-47ae-a82d-1eb47ee1e028" name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationContingentConsiderationAsset" unitRef="U_USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">44.3</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> million, comprised of $</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_c9f13dda-1618-4095-94ab-68467cd1a222" contextRef="C_12562f05-dc91-41af-beb5-7dc239777891" name="xper:BusinessDivestitureCashReceived" unitRef="U_USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">10.8</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> million of cash, a note receivable from Tobii (the &#8220;Tobii Note&#8221;) of $</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_05393435-2d11-40f6-b56f-7bf5a30273f6" contextRef="C_94315b7f-65c9-4d2b-9dd6-5c80ebef6083" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" unitRef="U