"color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">% of the grant. For PSUs subject to market conditions, the fair value per award is fixed at the grant date and the amount of compensation expense is not adjusted during the performance period regardless of changes in the level of achievement of the market condition.</span></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_9f494966-d423-45e6-bc42-a4560afe91a0" contextRef="C_3f7401cf-a0f6-4bec-8dc5-40117d216c69" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardPlanModificationDescriptionAndTerms"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">In April 2023, the Company modified certain vesting conditions related to market-based PSUs granted in 2022, resulting in a total incremental compensation expense of $</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_5f470211-74a5-480d-b9e5-f14247094214" contextRef="C_0785bd81-f135-4720-88c0-2d84aff71cc2" name="xper:IncrementalCompensationExpenseRecognizedOverRequisiteServicePeriodThroughTwoThousandAndTwentyFive" unitRef="U_USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">2.9</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> million, which was recognized over the remaining requisite service period through April 2025.</span></ix:nonNumeric></span></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kern